@chribjel @bot Thanks for the feedback!

What loading spinners are you referring to? We do have some but maybe not where you’re expecting. 

We also support pasting from your computer already. Can you share more?

@RhysSullivan @bot One interesting reflection for me is that we (at Cursor) tried (as well as many others) to make cloud agents a thing.

But it was the classic engineering mind putting the technical solution first vs. the end user benefit.

Bot is 100% cloud and people don't care!
